# Lost Chick (hidden quest LostChick), the edges of the chick var: a level 30 Warrior in Southern San d'Oria, the chick
# at owner 1 (Coderiant), 3 clues, San d'Oria (113). Coderiant asked and guessed right (updateEvent 1, the var solved);
# the chick again at Coderiant and a guess with no ask before it: nothing (the ask was spent by the first guess). A
# solved chick (bit 18) at the wrong owner (Cahaurme): the wrong answer keeps the solved bit. A chick at Bastok (location
# 2, owner 1: 177) is not San d'Oria's: Cahaurme plays only his own script. With the setting 0 (the Lua's truthiness:
# on) Violitte's 851 and Hantileon's report 852 play.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Violitte/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Hantileon/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/852 SouthernSanDoria/Cahaurme/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/583 SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/847
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-1,0,-105 job=WAR lvl=30
login
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 113
trigger Coderiant                       # 583
update 583 option=1                     # the ask
update 583 option=2                     # right
finish
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 113
trigger Coderiant                       # 583
update 583 option=2                     # the guess with no ask: nothing
finish
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 262257   # 113 + (1 << 18): solved
trigger Cahaurme                        # 847
update 847 option=1                     # wrong owner: WRONG_OWNER, solved kept
finish
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 177   # a Bastok chick
trigger Cahaurme                        # not San d'Oria's: his script
finish-if-event
setting ENABLE_CHOCOBO_RAISING 0        # Lua's truthiness: a 0 is on
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 113
trigger Violitte                        # 851 plays (an owner of the location)
finish
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 65649 # 113 + (1 << 16): a result to report
trigger Hantileon                       # 852 plays (the trainer's report)
finish
